Package: ubnt-dpi-update2
Version: 1.1.0-1
Architecture: mipsel
Maintainer: Kamishirasawa-keine <kurisu3a0f@outlook.com>
Section: net
Description: Update EdgeOS DPI signatures from the ASUS LiveUpdate servers
 The original dl.ubnt.com DPI signature source is dead (404); ASUS
 publishes the same Trend Micro TDTS signatures (rule.trf). Provides
 /usr/sbin/ubnt-update-dpi2, an hourly cron job honoring the
 signature-update configuration, the "update dpi2 signatures" op-mode
 command, and /usr/sbin/tdts-dpi-dump which can regenerate rule.xml and
 cats.xml from the loaded signatures (opt-in per update via "set system
 traffic-analysis signature-update regen-xml").